OL,3,GNEWSAG7 leaders hold urgent meeting
OL,4,Aover diesel supply as UK prices hit
OL,5,Arecord #2 a litre
OL,6,
OL,7,FLeaders from the G7 bloc of advanced
OL,8,Feconomies are meeting urgently by video
OL,9,Fconference to discuss global diesel
OL,10,Fsupply - Foreign Secretary Ed Miliband
OL,11,Fis attending for the UK
OL,13,FIt comes as US President Donald Trump
OL,14,Fsays he may ask European countries to
OL,15,Frelease diesel reserves as he considers
OL,16,Fbanning US exports of the fuel
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
