OL,3,GNEWSAG7 leaders hold urgent meeting
OL,4,Aover diesel supply as UK prices hit
OL,5,Arecord #2 a litre
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe move could bring prices down
OL,8,Fsignificantly for American drivers, but
OL,9,Fexperts warn it would put further
OL,10,Fpressure on diesel prices in other
OL,11,Fcountries, as the Iran war continues to
OL,12,Fput pressure on supply
OL,14,FAverage UK diesel prices have hit a
OL,15,Frecord high, according to motoring
OL,16,Fgroup the RAC, reaching #2 a litre for
OL,17,Fthe first time
OL,19,FHowever, UK Transport Minister Keir
OL,20,FMather says Britain's supply of diesel
OL,21,Fis "robust" and "resilient" and the
OL,22,Fcountry has a wide range of sources
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
